# Design System — Intervention Analytics System

Sourced from Google Stitch project `projects/11710553690432211807`. All tokens are registered in `tailwind.config.js`.

## Color Tokens (use as Tailwind classes)

### Surfaces (backgrounds)
| Token | Hex | Use |
|---|---|---|
| `bg-background` / `bg-surface` | `#f8f9ff` | Page background |
| `bg-surface-container-lowest` | `#ffffff` | Cards, modals |
| `bg-surface-container-low` | `#eff4ff` | Hover states |
| `bg-surface-container` | `#e5eeff` | Input backgrounds |
| `bg-surface-container-high` | `#dce9ff` | Table headers |
| `bg-primary-container` | `#131b2e` | Dark backgrounds |

### Semantic Status Colors
| State | Background | Text |
|---|---|---|
| Success / Compliant | `bg-emerald-600/10` | `text-emerald-600` (#059669) |
| Warning / At-Risk | `bg-amber-500/10` | `text-amber-500` (#f59e0b) |
| Error / Non-Compliant | `bg-error-container` | `text-error` (#ba1a1a) |
| Info / Action | `bg-secondary/10` | `text-secondary` (#0058be) |

### Key Semantic Roles
```
primary = #000000        (black, headings/CTA bg)
on-primary = #ffffff     (text on black)
secondary = #0058be      (professional blue, links/buttons)
on-secondary = #ffffff   (text on blue)
error = #ba1a1a          (crimson red, alerts)
on-surface = #0b1c30     (deep navy, body text)
on-surface-variant = #45464d  (muted labels)
outline-variant = #c6c6cd     (borders, dividers)
```

## Typography Scale
```jsx
// Headlines (Inter, weight 600-700)
className="text-display-lg font-display-lg"   // 48px — KPI numbers
className="text-headline-lg font-headline-lg" // 32px — Page titles
className="text-headline-md font-headline-md" // 24px — Section titles
className="text-headline-sm font-headline-sm" // 20px — Card titles

// Body (Inter, weight 400)
className="text-body-lg"  // 18px
className="text-body-md"  // 16px — Default body
className="text-body-sm"  // 14px — Table cells, nav links

// Labels (Inter, weight 500-600)
className="text-data-tabular font-data-tabular" // 14px — Table numbers (tabular)
className="text-label-md font-label-md"          // 12px — Uppercase metadata
```

## Spacing
```
xs = 4px   sm = 12px   md = 24px   lg = 40px   xl = 64px
gutter = 24px   base = 8px   container-max = 1440px
```
Use `p-md`, `gap-md`, `space-y-lg`, `px-gutter` etc.

## Border Radius
- `rounded-lg` → 4px (buttons, badges, inputs)
- `rounded-xl` → 8px (cards, containers)  
- `rounded-full` → pill (avatars, tags)

## Icons (Material Symbols Outlined)
```jsx
<span className="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary">dashboard</span>
// Filled variant:
<span className="material-symbols-outlined" style={{ fontVariationSettings: "'FILL' 1" }}>dashboard</span>
// Size override:
<span className="material-symbols-outlined" style={{ fontSize: 16 }}>search</span>
```
Never use emoji or SVG icons — always use Material Symbols.
